**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Logs und temporäre Dateien
*.log
*.pid
*.tmp
.DS_Store

# Vite / Webpack Cache
**/.vite
**/.turbo

# Test-Artefakte
**/coverage
**/__snapshots__

# Editor-Metadaten
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*.swo

# Git
.git
.gitignore

# Docker selbst
**/Dockerfile
**/.dockerignore
infra/k8s
infra/observability

# Secrets — nie in den Build-Kontext
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/certs/*.pem
**/certs/*.key
**/certs/*.crt

# Dokumentation
docs
README.md
CHANGELOG.md
